message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "ANA–SNIRH Spatial Station Finder"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ramirez"
    given-names: "Jamil"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-3386-8571"
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-19"
license: "MIT"
url: "https://01a00cf4-6b8b-26f2-7fe6-e455d88a9978.share.connect.posit.cloud"
abstract: >-
  Interactive Shiny application for spatial and temporal screening of
  ANA/SNIRH hydrometeorological stations in Peru, including station-level
  diagnostics, multi-geometry spatial analysis, optimized common-window
  selection, access to archived official reports, and user-directed
  normalized wide-format daily data export.
keywords:
  - hydrology
  - hydrometeorology
  - precipitation
  - streamflow
  - station screening
  - ANA
  - SNIRH
  - Peru
  - Shiny
